# Per-developer Claude Code overrides. `.claude/plans/` is deliberately NOT
# ignored — a plan is a design artifact worth reviewing alongside the diff.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Scratch space for positioning notes, drafts, and ideas that are not yet decisions.
# Deliberately ignored, unlike `.claude/plans/` — a plan is a design artifact reviewed
# alongside its diff, whereas these are thinking-in-progress with no build contract.
future-plans/

